{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","毁灭之斧"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Devastating Axe"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","击倒单名敌人并降低其护甲。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Kruger launches a mighty slash to knock down an enemy and reduces their Phys DEF."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对一名敌人进行强力斩击，击倒目标1.5秒，对目标造成450% + 50% ATK伤害并施加3层“碎甲”效果。每1层“碎甲”会使目标护甲降低10%，每个目标最多叠加4层。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Kruger launches a mighty slash to knock down an enemy for 1.5s, dealing 450% + 50% ATK damage and inflicting them with 3 stacks of Shatter Armor. Each stack reduces the target's Phys DEF by 10%, up to 4 stacks on a target."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":76,"end":82,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":72,"end":86,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","当克鲁格在场时，友军在降低敌方单位护甲的同时会额外施加1层“碎甲”效果。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","If Kruger is present, the ally inflicts enemies with an extra stack of Shatter Armor when reducing their Phys DEF."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至465% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 465% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至480% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 480% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至500% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 500% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","破碎挥击"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Smashing Assault"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","攻击敌人并降低其护甲。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Kruger attacks an enemy, reducing their Phys DEF."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","挥砍一名敌人，造成240% + 30% ATK伤害并施加1层“碎甲”效果。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Kruger slashes an enemy, dealing 240% + 30% ATK damage and inflicting them with a stack of Shatter Armor."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":33,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 260% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 280% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 300% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","要害打击"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Vital Strike"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","附近有敌人护甲较低时，对其造成伤害并使其获得“暴露要害”，提升受到的物理伤害与克鲁格对其的生命汲取。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Kruger deals damage and inflicts Vulnerable on enemies with low Phys DEF. These targets receive more physical damage, and Kruger drains more HP from them."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若附近敌军的“碎甲”层数不小于4层且没有“暴露要害”时，重击该目标，对其造成400% + 50% ATK伤害并使目标“暴露要害”。“暴露要害”的目标所受的物理伤害提升40%。当克鲁格对“暴露要害”的目标造成伤害时恢复相当于伤害量40%的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Kruger launches a powerful attack on adjacent enemies with at least 4 stacks of Shatter Armor and not affected by Vulnerable, dealing 400% + 50% ATK damage and inflicting Vulnerable. For Vulnerable enemies, their physical damage taken is increased by 40%, and 40% of their damage taken is transformed to Kruger's HP."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":138,"end":144,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":134,"end":148,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至440% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 440% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至480% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 480% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 520% + 50% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身远程防御。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Ranged DEF during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的远程防御提升16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Ranged DEF by 16 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的远程防御提升21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Ranged DEF by 21 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的远程防御提升26点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Ranged DEF by 26 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","孤胆独行"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Ruthless Vanguard"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，若附近没有友军，则获得护盾。战斗中，若附近没有友军，则提升生命汲取。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Kruger gains a shield if no allies are nearby when a battle starts. During the battle, he gains Life Drain when no allies are nearby."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，如果周围1格内没有友军，则获得可抵御40% HP伤害的护盾，持续15秒，护盾存在期间免控。战斗中，如果周围1格内没有友军，克鲁格增加30点生命汲取。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Kruger gains a shield that blocks damage equal to 40% HP for 15s if no allies are present within the surrounding 1 tile. The shield also grants him control immunity. Additionally, Kruger gains 30 Life Drain when no allies are detected within the surrounding 1 tile."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":72,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至44% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 44% HP."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“要害打击”不再有距离限制（其他限制不变），克鲁格可以冲向符合条件敌人，并释放“要害打击”。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Removes the distance limit for Vital Strike (the other restrictions remain). Kruger can rush to Vulnerable enemies and cast Vital Strike to deal damage."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾值提升至48% HP。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 48% HP."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":12,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“暴露要害”的敌人被击败时，克鲁格攻击力永久提升。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Kruger gains an ATK boost when a Vulnerable enemy is defeated."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当技能“要害打击”造成“暴露要害”的敌人被击败时，克鲁格攻击力提升40%，该效果最多可叠加2次，直至战斗结束。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Kruger gains a 40% ATK boost until the battle ends when a Vulnerable enemy is defeated by Vital Strike, stacking up to 2 stacks."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","蛮石战斧"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Savage Axe"]]}